<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF A MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF A MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
